{
  "schema_version": "1.7.0",
  "id": "USN-8831-1",
  "summary": "libvirt vulnerabilities",
  "details": "It was discovered that libvirt had an integer overflow vulnerability in\nthe NodeGetFreePages RPC handler. A local attacker could possibly use\nthis issue to cause a denial of service or execute arbitrary code.\n(CVE-2026-18917)\n\nIt was discovered that libvirt did not correctly handle symbolic links\nwhen changing ownership of the TPM emulator log file. A local attacker\nwith access to the swtpm account could possibly use this issue to cause libvirt\nto change the ownership of an arbitrary file. (CVE-2026-77159)",
